WEBVTT

00:19:29.141 --> 00:19:31.796
in the category of engaged workaholic.

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:33.606
So much so, that two years ago,

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:36.296
when Joanne began having
some pretty odd headaches,

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:37.866
she brushed them off.

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.700
JM: I was working a lot of hours.

00:19:39.724 --> 00:19:40.878
I had two little kids.

00:19:40.902 --> 00:19:43.006
There was just work, life.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:47.922
My own health was probably falling
to the last of my priorities at the time.

00:19:47.946 --> 00:19:49.398
AG: At the urging of her wife,

00:19:49.422 --> 00:19:52.774
Joanne finally met with the doctor,
who ordered some tests.

00:19:52.798 --> 00:19:54.716
When he came back with the results --

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.731
JM: They didn't need to tell me anything.

00:19:56.755 --> 00:19:59.392
The X-ray was actually
sitting on the X-ray machine,

00:19:59.416 --> 00:20:02.716
and as clear as day,
I could see the tumor.